{"vid":"Vt9RjqMNP9o","source":"Vt9RjqMNP9o.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":4.5,"txt":"What's the difference between a near"},{"t":6.4,"txt":"miss and an incident? Understanding this"},{"t":9.8,"txt":"could save lives at your workplace."},{"t":12.7,"txt":"Let's break it down. A near miss is an"},{"t":16.1,"txt":"unplanned event that did not result in"},{"t":19,"txt":"injury, illness, or damage, but had the"},{"t":21.8,"txt":"potential to do so. Example, a worker"},{"t":25.8,"txt":"slips on an oily floor but regains"},{"t":28.2,"txt":"balance and doesn't fall. The outcome,"},{"t":31.6,"txt":"no injury occurred, but it could have"},{"t":34.2,"txt":"caused harm. What you must do?"},{"t":37.7,"txt":"Investigate and correct the cause"},{"t":39.8,"txt":"immediately. Even though nobody got"},{"t":43,"txt":"hurt, the hazard is real. Fix it before"},{"t":46.5,"txt":"someone does get injured. An incident is"},{"t":50.2,"txt":"any unplanned event that causes or could"},{"t":53,"txt":"cause injury, illness, damage, or loss."},{"t":56.6,"txt":"Example, a worker slips on the same oily"},{"t":60,"txt":"floor and gets injured. Maybe a sprained"},{"t":63.2,"txt":"ankle or broken bone. The outcome, this"},{"t":66.7,"txt":"is an incident, accident because it"},{"t":69.6,"txt":"caused injury. What you must do? Report,"},{"t":74.2,"txt":"investigate, and prevent recurrence."},{"t":77.3,"txt":"This goes into your safety records. You"},{"t":80.6,"txt":"need root cause analysis and corrective"},{"t":83.4,"txt":"actions. Here's the critical difference."},{"t":87.2,"txt":"Near miss equals potential harm, no"},{"t":90.6,"txt":"actual injury, a warning sign. Incident"},{"t":94.1,"txt":"equals actual harm occurred. Injury,"},{"t":97.6,"txt":"damage, or loss. Both are red flags. The"},{"t":101.8,"txt":"only difference is luck. A near miss"},{"t":104.5,"txt":"today could be a serious incident"},{"t":106.4,"txt":"tomorrow if you don't act. Every near"},{"t":109.4,"txt":"miss is a free lesson. Don't waste it."},{"t":113.6,"txt":"Many workplaces fail because workers"},{"t":116.8,"txt":"don't report near misses. They think"},{"t":119.8,"txt":"nobody got hurt so it's fine. Near miss"},{"t":123.6,"txt":"reporting is one of the most powerful"},{"t":125.7,"txt":"leading indicators of safety"},{"t":127.6,"txt":"performance. It shows you where your"},{"t":130.3,"txt":"hazards are before someone gets"},{"t":132.8,"txt":"seriously injured. Encourage your team"},{"t":136.2,"txt":"to report every near miss without fear"},{"t":138.7,"txt":"of blame. Does your workplace have a"},{"t":141.5,"txt":"near miss reporting system? If not,"},{"t":144.2,"txt":"create one today. Investigate every near"},{"t":147.4,"txt":"miss like it was a serious incident. Fix"},{"t":150.5,"txt":"the root cause. Prevent the next"},{"t":152.7,"txt":"accident. Comment below. Do you report"},{"t":156,"txt":"near misses at your workplace?"}],"words":[{"t":4.48,"w":"What's"},{"t":4.799,"w":"the"},{"t":5.04,"w":"difference"},{"t":5.44,"w":"between"},{"t":5.839,"w":"a"},{"t":6.08,"w":"near"},{"t":6.4,"w":"miss"},{"t":6.879,"w":"and"},{"t":7.2,"w":"an"},{"t":7.44,"w":"incident?"},{"t":8.8,"w":"Understanding"},{"t":9.519,"w":"this"},{"t":9.84,"w":"could"},{"t":10.16,"w":"save"},{"t":10.48,"w":"lives"},{"t":11.04,"w":"at"},{"t":11.36,"w":"your"},{"t":11.599,"w":"workplace."},{"t":12.719,"w":"Let's"},{"t":13.28,"w":"break"},{"t":13.519,"w":"it"},{"t":13.759,"w":"down."},{"t":14.719,"w":"A"},{"t":14.96,"w":"near"},{"t":15.28,"w":"miss"},{"t":15.599,"w":"is"},{"t":15.839,"w":"an"},{"t":16.08,"w":"unplanned"},{"t":16.72,"w":"event"},{"t":17.279,"w":"that"},{"t":17.68,"w":"did"},{"t":17.92,"w":"not"},{"t":18.24,"w":"result"},{"t":18.64,"w":"in"},{"t":18.96,"w":"injury,"},{"t":19.68,"w":"illness,"},{"t":20,"w":"or"},{"t":20.32,"w":"damage,"},{"t":20.96,"w":"but"},{"t":21.279,"w":"had"},{"t":21.52,"w":"the"},{"t":21.76,"w":"potential"},{"t":22.32,"w":"to"},{"t":22.64,"w":"do"},{"t":22.8,"w":"so."},{"t":23.84